    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## **Payroll Processing**\n\n## **Overview**\nAutomates payroll processing by retrieving employee overtime data, updating payroll records, calculating gross and net pay, and generating digital payslips for employees.\n\n1. **Fetch Overtime Data**  \n   - The workflow retrieves overtime records from the **Overtime Check** sheet.  \n   - Each entry contains the employee ID and total overtime hours worked.\n\n2. **Update Payroll Sheet**  \n   - The overtime data is matched with the respective employee’s record in the **Payroll Sheet**.  \n   - Overtime hours are added for payroll calculation.\n\n3. **Retrieve Payroll Information**  \n   - The workflow extracts employee salary details.\n\n4. **Calculate Gross & Net Pay**  \n\n\n\n\n\n",
        "height": 720,
        "width": 832
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
