      "name": "Sticky Note1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Generate Payslip\n\n1. **Generate Payslip**  \n   - An HTML-based payslip is created for each employee. \n\n2. **Notification**  \n   - Payslips will be sent to employees via email.  \n   - The email will contain the payslip details directly in the message body or as a downloadable PDF.",
